When considering \(j\) unit cells connected in an array horizontally (for example, Fig.~\ref{fig:Fig2}(b) illustrates \(j=2\) unit cells connected in such an array), the dimensionless total potential energy of the \(j\) unit cells is represented by Eq.~\eqref{Eq:eq4}.
